review_text:
Kind of average in general. If you are expecting a thrilling-horror experience - this game is not for you.

But what makes it even worse than average is:
- poor balance between regular/boss enemies;
- upgrades feels almost useless;
- jelly-like controls of protagonist;

But it has its pros also:
- good visuals;
- OKish cinematics;
- good perf optimization;

In overall would not recommend this game (unless there is an 75%+ discount).
